        "quote": "It shall be unlawful for a mobile food vendor to do any of the following:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.210:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.115.210 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "11082264-737d-5a78-8f28-81358d830fd1",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 119,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.210:block:1",
          "start": 74
        },
        "quote": "(a) Failing to comply with zoning ordinances.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.210:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.115.210 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "b7acc505-9146-5fe9-8bc7-ba90d16fcfbe",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 375,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.210:block:2",
          "start": 120
        },
        "quote": "(b) Locating a unit where the unit or a line of customers would hinder vehicular, pedestrian or bicycle traffic or block or reduce sidewalk access to less than five feet in width for passage of wheelchairs and electric personal assistive mobility devices.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.210:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.115.210 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "77c429cd-acff-5305-aa04-5a24348fedfb",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 479,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.210:block:3",
          "start": 376
        },
        "quote": "(c) Blocking or obstructing access to residences, businesses, driveways or access points to a property.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.210:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.115.210 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "b8f909e9-9681-54fb-b75f-7842c2e8be2f",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 567,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.210:block:4",
          "start": 480
        },
        "quote": "(d) Operating on private property without the written permission of the property owner.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.210:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.115.210 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "5ef08461-7091-5f25-bb8c-d3d67828e488",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 635,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.210:block:5",
          "start": 568
        },
        "quote": "(e) Conducting business between the hours of midnight and 7:00 a.m.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.210:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.115.210 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "c18d82bc-5a7d-5889-bcad-47d9a21809a9",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1002,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.210:block:6",
          "start": 636
        },
        "quote": "(f) Failing to have a trash receptacle attached to the unit or located within 15 feet of the unit. The receptacle cannot interfere with vehicle access, pedestrian movement or handicap-accessible routes to and around the unit. Immediately upon cessation of vending, the vendor shall remove and properly dispose of all trash and litter accumulated at the vending site.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.210:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.115.210 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "881d8852-ad38-548d-a612-a3a6625bdeac",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1237,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.210:block:7",
          "start": 1003
        },
        "quote": "(g) Failing to maintain any license or certification required by the State of Kansas or Shawnee County. Upon request, the vendor shall provide such documents to any law enforcement officer or City employee. (Ord. 20039 § 21, 12-6-16.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.210:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
